; 预算更新演示：同一天连续写入 2222、111、222，最后生效的是 222。
; 请把本文件放进一个全新的账本，避免和现有账本的数据混淆。

option "title" "预算更新演示"
option "operating_currency" "CNY"

2026-09-01 open Assets:Bank:Wallet CNY
2026-09-01 open Expenses:Food CNY
2026-09-01 open Expenses:健康 CNY
2026-09-01 open Equity:Opening-Balances CNY

2026-09-01 * "期初余额"
  Assets:Bank:Wallet          10000 CNY
  Equity:Opening-Balances    -10000 CNY

; 9 月餐饮合计 800 + 600 + 700 = 2100 CNY
2026-09-05 * "超市" "九月餐饮 1"
  Expenses:Food                 800 CNY
  Assets:Bank:Wallet           -800 CNY

2026-09-12 * "餐厅" "九月餐饮 2"
  Expenses:Food                 600 CNY
  Assets:Bank:Wallet           -600 CNY

2026-09-20 * "外卖" "九月餐饮 3"
  Expenses:Food                 700 CNY
  Assets:Bank:Wallet           -700 CNY

; 10 月餐饮合计 1200 + 900 + 700 = 2800 CNY
2026-10-02 * "超市" "十月餐饮 1"
  Expenses:Food                1200 CNY
  Assets:Bank:Wallet          -1200 CNY

2026-10-10 * "餐厅" "十月餐饮 2"
  Expenses:Food                 900 CNY
  Assets:Bank:Wallet           -900 CNY

2026-10-18 * "外卖" "十月餐饮 3"
  Expenses:Food                 700 CNY
  Assets:Bank:Wallet           -700 CNY

; 预算版本记录。它们不会相加，每条都是同一账户、同一币种、
; 同一时间间隔下的一份“目标版本”，以日期决定何时生效。
2026-09-01 custom "budget" Expenses:Food "MONTHLY" 2500 CNY
2026-10-01 custom "budget" Expenses:Food "MONTHLY" 5000 CNY

; 同一天连续更新三次。文件中最后追加的 222 才是最终值。
2026-10-18 custom "budget" Expenses:Food "MONTHLY" 2222 CNY
2026-10-18 custom "budget" Expenses:Food "MONTHLY" 111 CNY

2026-10-03 * "减龄（北京）科技有限公司" "微信支付账单同步"
  Assets:Bank:Wallet                                   -336 CNY
  Expenses:健康                                           336 CNY

